            <text_box x="1203" y="145" uid="45" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" text-align="center" padding="5" width="489" height="108">Many elements contribute to an individual&apos;s Blood Alcohol Concentration. The following elements are incorporated into this model:&#x0D;</text_box>
            <text_box x="1199" y="38" uid="46" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" font-style="italic" text-align="center" padding="5" width="490" height="35">Elements of the Model</text_box>
            <text_box x="1376" y="194" uid="47" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="14" padding="5" width="167" height="66">• Number of drinks&#x0D;• Body weight&#x0D;• Gender&#x0D;• Time</text_box>
            <text_box x="1772" y="13" uid="48" color="#E0E0E0" font-family="Arial" font-size="24" font-weight="bold" font-style="italic" text-align="center" padding="5" width="490" height="35">Common Situations</text_box>
